span.p:
1 approval: domain team;
on-call group only for an open incident,
approver on shift (OD9, OD27)

Ruleset on main: approver is not author
or last pusher; stale approvals dismissed;
branch up to date; squash only

Deploy job, main only, one environment per kind of stack:
production, production-iam, production-db (OD22);
OIDC role; deploys only the tip of main
